Z||000000||Fierochic88||05-31-2001||06:47 PM||||Over the weekend my mom was cleaning out the Garage and found a box which contained the original documents and photos from when my parents won the 1985 GT that my dad still has and shows (64,000 miles!!).  It was really neat.  The box had the press photos that the newspaper took, along with the original letter stating my parents won a prize in the "MAC AGAIN BACK AGAIN" sweepstakes (didn't say what they won) and then the March 15,1985 letter saying they won a Fiero (one of the "sportiest, speediest cars on the road today").  It also contained the orginal advertisement for the sweepstakes.  As well as the documentation of my dad upgrading the Sport Coupe to a GT.  It was soooo neat!  I'm going to mat everything and frame it for my dad for father's day so he can display it with the car.  If I can get my scanner to work I will try and scan the stuff!<P>Jennifer<P>------------------<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>||||reg||10
